  "rationale": "Six members from the earliest-published paper of each JKP price theme that the bars can compute: momentum (four Jegadeesh and Titman formation windows, skipping the latest month), short-term reversal (one month, sign reversed) and low risk (one-year CAPM idiosyncratic volatility, sign reversed), taken from the published tables of bkelly-lab/ReplicationCrisis for member selection only. Each member is z-scored, z-scored within its Fama-French 12 sector, residualised on beta_60 and log dollar volume and z-scored again; members average within a theme, themes average with equal weight, and nothing is fitted. No IC had been computed on this machinery when the file was frozen. A change is a new version.",
